# Accessibility Rules

## Semantic HTML
- **Proper elements**: Use semantic HTML elements
- **Headings**: Use proper heading hierarchy (h1-h6)
- **Landmarks**: Use ARIA landmarks where needed

## ARIA
- **Labels**: Provide ARIA labels for interactive elements
- **Roles**: Use ARIA roles when needed
- **States**: Indicate element states (disabled, expanded, etc.)

## Keyboard Navigation
- **Focus management**: Manage focus properly
- **Tab order**: Logical tab order
- **Keyboard shortcuts**: Provide keyboard shortcuts where appropriate

## Best Practices
- **Color contrast**: Ensure sufficient color contrast
- **Alt text**: Provide alt text for images
- **Form labels**: Always label form inputs
- **Error messages**: Provide clear error messages
